<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 281 MLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 281 MLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 281 million zlotys worth of Polish T-bills against the treasury's 400 million zloty offer, The National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
